            "id": "20260903A0509D00",
            "title": "财务造假余波未了，上实发展迈入第三年亏损丨中报观察",
            "image": "https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OVKsQSaSHwIwLMTscLKSLdNZCbW2N2Z8oO4J5-GSg15ZUAA_870492/0",
